cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: Passenger and parcel solver for SOICT 2026 Round 2
type: software
authors:
  - name: Team S4T2A8
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-11-16
version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  A single-threaded C++17 solver for the Integrated Passenger and Parcel
  Transportation problem. It combines exact route enumeration, adaptive large
  neighborhood search and slack induction by string removals with route
  recombination and exact route reassignment.
keywords:
  - vehicle routing
  - pickup and delivery
  - large neighborhood search
  - SOICT 2026
